Changed: Set the ghost values of a staggered velocity outside physical boundaries in IBAMR::IBHierarchyIntegrator with the divergence-free velocity boundary operator of IBAMR::INSStaggeredHierarchyIntegrator or IBAMR::INSVCStaggeredHierarchyIntegrator, and spread forces with its transpose, so that spreading and interpolation are adjoint with TRACTION conditions. IBAMR::CIBMethod and IBAMR::ConstraintIBMethod use that operator if setVelocityPhysBdryOp() is not called.
